                    {
                        "translation_id": "4afdf6e3-445c-4fcf-93fa-94f957f1c4df",
                        "source_entry_id": "3a214148-44f0-3461-9cad-14c895e384db",
                        "source_sense_id": "d246ce57-4b33-3436-88ee-69cee17c5d9c",
                        "source_sense_description": "zoals inmiddels duidelijk is geworden",
                        "target_lang_word": "apparently",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "apparently",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6236f0d2-3b0e-3ca1-a4a9-45cbc3e84a81",
                                        "entry_id": "dacc25af-db06-3a95-a9c0-46b4529e42cf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Plainly; clearly; manifestly; evidently."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "845e893b-9f78-4967-96af-b5e2e7c19f22",
                                                "sense_id": "6236f0d2-3b0e-3ca1-a4a9-45cbc3e84a81",
                                                "text": "If he should scorn me so apparently."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02e20786-fa66-44bf-ac80-8e74a76db730",
                                                "sense_id": "6236f0d2-3b0e-3ca1-a4a9-45cbc3e84a81",
                                                "text": "One, my lord, that doth so palpably, so apparently make her adulteries a trophy, whiles the poting-stick to her unsatiate goatish abomination jeers at, and flouts your sleepish, and more than sleepish, security."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "02b9a4ee-57cd-3cff-9b0e-93147c4164af",
                                        "entry_id": "dacc25af-db06-3a95-a9c0-46b4529e42cf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Seemingly; in appearance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17632980-be42-46b4-a213-808792486d5e",
                                                "sense_id": "02b9a4ee-57cd-3cff-9b0e-93147c4164af",
                                                "text": "A man may be apparently friendly, yet malicious in heart."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ac21fa0-00c6-459f-a706-b6d1902c7958",
                                                "sense_id": "02b9a4ee-57cd-3cff-9b0e-93147c4164af",
                                                "text": "The r-stems had apparently been reduced to the five nuclear kinship terms that still survive in Modern English."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d44f1e54-3d7e-3612-81f9-bb342fa379c5",
                                        "entry_id": "dacc25af-db06-3a95-a9c0-46b4529e42cf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "According to what the speaker has read or heard."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fdde7d89-130b-463c-8181-2f82c36e5898",
                                                "sense_id": "d44f1e54-3d7e-3612-81f9-bb342fa379c5",
                                                "text": "Apparently you are quite a good dancer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "936d47ec-319e-46af-a3a2-d672a2c9010e",
                                                "sense_id": "d44f1e54-3d7e-3612-81f9-bb342fa379c5",
                                                "text": "\"[…] Apparently they are going to contact the adoption agency and see if they can locate that child. […]\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5ddb8ab-e3de-4f76-83d1-45bc078298d8",
                                                "sense_id": "d44f1e54-3d7e-3612-81f9-bb342fa379c5",
                                                "text": "Similarly, the new move to apparently involve the National Guard in ICE operations could rub people the wrong way."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7d7256d8-ee5b-3dd6-ab02-b8577ada3865",
                                        "entry_id": "dacc25af-db06-3a95-a9c0-46b4529e42cf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "According to what one can deduce."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "often",
                                            "sarcastic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a634ca1-de4b-4b9d-a5c8-24f6cbfd5965",
                                                "sense_id": "7d7256d8-ee5b-3dd6-ab02-b8577ada3865",
                                                "text": "Peridot: I can tell you with certainty that there are things on this planet worth protecting!\nYellow Diamond: What do you know about the Earth?!\nPeridot: Apparently more than you, you clod!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "158d31df-f2eb-4fe1-9012-aca6ee92a3fa",
                        "source_entry_id": "3a214148-44f0-3461-9cad-14c895e384db",
                        "source_sense_id": "d246ce57-4b33-3436-88ee-69cee17c5d9c",
                        "source_sense_description": "zoals inmiddels duidelijk is geworden",
                        "target_lang_word": "evident",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "evident",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f0195ee-d734-31fb-86fc-0af31cb1ab28",
                                        "entry_id": "c72d2f8e-d821-3e27-b96b-e449a5b92d17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Obviously true by simple observation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1ecdf01-e024-41f0-a2fb-95820bd8d863",
                                                "sense_id": "9f0195ee-d734-31fb-86fc-0af31cb1ab28",
                                                "text": "It was evident she was angry, after she slammed the door."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33ff7502-5446-4877-86bc-d88ea370683c",
                                                "sense_id": "9f0195ee-d734-31fb-86fc-0af31cb1ab28",
                                                "text": "Maccario, it was evident, did not care to take the risk of blundering upon a picket, and a man led them by twisting paths until at last the hacienda rose blackly before them."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cef1f4c1-dc31-4a09-99c1-6753053eec3c",
                        "source_entry_id": "3a214148-44f0-3461-9cad-14c895e384db",
                        "source_sense_id": "d246ce57-4b33-3436-88ee-69cee17c5d9c",
                        "source_sense_description": "zoals inmiddels duidelijk is geworden",
                        "target_lang_word": "obvious",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "obvious",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fbfe513c-e5ff-3b8b-abed-214d77ee1514",
                                        "entry_id": "9380d2c7-70a1-3948-96eb-e87eacaf6b46",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Easily discovered, seen, or understood; self-explanatory."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e02262c-9d3c-4041-a85f-ddcf653f8651",
                                                "sense_id": "fbfe513c-e5ff-3b8b-abed-214d77ee1514",
                                                "text": "Carried somehow, somewhither, for some reason, on these surging floods, were these travelers, of errand not wholly obvious to their fellows, yet of such sort as to call into query alike the nature of their errand and their own relations. It is easily earned repetition to state that Josephine St. Auban's was a presence not to be concealed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25fb8dee-22b8-4196-a2d7-ff59eea3194e",
                                                "sense_id": "fbfe513c-e5ff-3b8b-abed-214d77ee1514",
                                                "text": "During the first year or so of British Railways, some of the simpler and more obvious inter-regional transfers of outlying sections were effected, such as those of the London, Tilbury & Southend Railway from the London Midland Region to the Eastern Region; the South Wales lines of the former L.M.S.R. to the Western Region; the Carlisle-Silloth branch (an L.N.E.R. legacy of a North British \"border raid\") to the London Midland, and so on."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8103f93a-f833-4382-a776-0dcba8999a06",
                                                "sense_id": "fbfe513c-e5ff-3b8b-abed-214d77ee1514",
                                                "text": "One of the most obvious results of the B.R. Modernisation Plan has been the increasing use of diesel and electric traction; a less obvious by-product is the increase in track damage possible with the new forms of traction."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "960b60a9-1916-4d98-b547-a7aa9b375ee5",
                                                "sense_id": "fbfe513c-e5ff-3b8b-abed-214d77ee1514",
                                                "text": "'Cause I threw you the obvious / to see what occurs behind / the eyes of a fallen angel / Eyes of a tragedy / Oh well, oh well / Apparently nothing / Apparently nothing at all"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e071d800-5e28-40b3-9165-db2c808e99cd",
                                                "sense_id": "fbfe513c-e5ff-3b8b-abed-214d77ee1514",
                                                "text": "It is not obvious, to economists anyway, that cities should exist at all. Crowds of people mean congestion and costly land and labour. But there are also well-known advantages to bunching up. When transport costs are sufficiently high a firm can spend more money shipping goods to clusters of consumers than it saves on cheap land and labour."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
